to control two types of Hormone at once!

287
00:17:20,240 --> 00:17:22,534
There's no way he can get through that!

288
00:17:23,480 --> 00:17:24,310
What?

289
00:17:24,393 --> 00:17:25,223
That...

290
00:17:25,306 --> 00:17:26,136
that was amazing!

291
00:17:26,219 --> 00:17:28,977
I'm glad Caesar was able to find
his way through the oil somehow,

292
00:17:29,060 --> 00:17:32,589
but there's no way I can pull
off a hormone stunt like that.

293
00:17:35,720 --> 00:17:37,520
