Please, Coach!

297
00:17:50,100 --> 00:17:51,437
Jojo can't make it through that!

298
00:17:51,520 --> 00:17:53,814
You've got to turn off the oil for him!

299
00:17:54,500 --> 00:17:56,660
The man has no patience at all!

300
00:17:56,900 --> 00:18:01,100
He'll undoubtedly try some stupid
Tarot stunt any second now!

301
00:18:01,360 --> 00:18:03,000
And he'll fail!

302
