335
00:20:03,760 --> 00:20:06,000
I was not mad at you earlier, Jojo.

336
00:20:06,920 --> 00:20:07,820
I'm sorry.

337
00:20:08,140 --> 00:20:12,022
Forgive me, coach, but I just
couldn't let Jojo go down like that.

338
00:20:13,820 --> 00:20:15,820
