any strength left yourself.

340
00:20:19,460 --> 00:20:20,800
Oh, I forgot!

341
00:20:21,120 --> 00:20:23,377
I could really use your other arm here!

342
00:20:23,460 --> 00:20:25,280
Don't let me go! Caesar!

343
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:31,520
Ten seconds later, and after saying,
don't let me go another 13 times,

344
00:20:31,840 --> 00:20:33,075
Jojo reaches the top!

345
00:20:35,260 --> 00:20:36,680
Hello again, coach.

346
00:20:37,200 --> 00:20:39,435
I bet you thought I was done for, huh?

347
00:20:40,260 --> 00:20:43,717
I want you to know that while I was
clinging to that pillar for dear life,

348
00:20:43,800 --> 00:20:45,037
I had time to think to myself,

349
00:20:45,120 --> 00:20:48,240
How should I exact my
revenge upon that witch?

350
00:20:48,640 --> 00:20:50,581
Should I challenge her to a duel?

351
00:20:50,780 --> 00:20:54,074
Or maybe I should just squeeze
her nose until she cries?

352
00:20:54,300 --> 00:20:55,418
That's interesting.

353
00:20:55,620 --> 00:20:59,557
I didn't think Jojo would be the type
that would hold a grudge like that.

354
00:20:59,640 --> 00:21:01,540
So which will it be, coach?

355
00:21:05,000 --> 00:21:06,220
I'm doing it!

356
00:21:06,340 --> 00:21:07,417
I'm really doing it!

357
00:21:07,500 --> 00:21:10,277
I'm holding the water in the
cup and it's upside down!

358
00:21:10,360 --> 00:21:11,260
That's great!

359
00:21:11,680 --> 00:21:15,680
In only three excruciating days,
he's improved his hormone control!

360
