364
00:21:27,060 --> 00:21:29,897
You've got to give me more
training, I beg you, please!

365
00:21:29,980 --> 00:21:31,237
You'll see what I can do.

366
00:21:31,320 --> 00:21:32,673
I'll overcome anything.

367
00:21:33,300 --> 00:21:34,897
Well, that was pretty quick.

368
