to hold a grudge for very long.

369
00:21:38,160 --> 00:21:39,560
Oh, don't worry, Jojo.

370
00:21:39,760 --> 00:21:41,466
I've got plenty more for you.

371
00:21:41,560 --> 00:21:44,660
